+  "Transfer to this computer and renew automatically": "迁移到此电脑并自动续期",
+  "Requires a refresh credential in the file. Transferring rotates the sign-in; the original device may need to sign in again. Without this option, only the current access authorization is imported.": "需要文件中包含刷新凭据。迁移会轮换登录凭据，原设备可能需要重新登录。不勾选时只导入当前访问授权。",
+  "This file has no refresh credential. Sign in on this computer to enable automatic renewal.": "文件没有刷新凭据，请在此电脑直接登录以启用自动续期。",
+  "The refresh credential is invalid.": "刷新凭据格式无效。",
+  "Invalid refresh expiration time.": "刷新凭据的到期时间无效。",
+  "The refresh credential has expired. Sign in on this computer again.": "刷新凭据已过期，请在此电脑重新登录。",
+  "Ready to transfer this sign-in and enable automatic renewal.": "可迁移此登录并启用自动续期。",
